menu_resource:15e13026aea62e34.text:
　Link the Jigoku-hen and Rengoku-hen clear status saved on the network to this game.

　For Cleared Playthroughs, the higher count takes priority; for Scenario Chart, a completed chart takes priority;
　　　　　and for Game Clear, data with a completed game takes priority.

